1
00:00:07,633 --> 00:00:10,971
♪ Mokku, Mokku, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪
Mokku, Mokku, Oak Tree Mokku

2
00:00:10,995 --> 00:00:15,420
♪ Mokku, Mokku, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪
Mokku, Mokku, Oak Tree Mokku

3
00:00:17,362 --> 00:00:20,698
♪ Chisana boushi wo yokocho ni, Mokku! ♪
Wearing his little hat tilted to the side, Mokku!

4
00:00:20,699 --> 00:00:26,899
♪ Yondara kubi dake kururi to, Mokku! ♪ 
When you call him, his head spins right around, Mokku!

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,892
♪ Mokku ga waraeba minna mo warau ♪ 
When Mokku smiles, everyone smiles too

6
00:00:33,989 --> 00:00:36,480
♪ Hora hora koinu mo ♪ 
Look, look, even the puppy

7
00:00:37,244 --> 00:00:40,000
♪ kakete kuru ♪ 
comes running over

8
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:43,483
♪ Piko piko pin pin, piko piko pin! ♪ 

9
00:00:43,508 --> 00:00:50,065
♪ Minna no Mokku, tanoshi Mokku! ♪ 
Everyone's Mokku, joyful Mokku!

10
00:00:50,396 --> 00:00:56,196
♪ Hora hora hora hora, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪ 
Look, look, look, look, Oak Tree Mokku!

11
00:01:07,075 --> 00:01:10,069
♪ Piko piko pin pin, piko piko pin! ♪

12
00:01:10,264 --> 00:01:16,900
♪ Minna no Mokku, tanoshi Mokku! ♪
Everyone's Mokku, joyful Mokku!

13
00:01:17,030 --> 00:01:23,227
♪ Hora hora hora hora, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪
Look, look, look, look, Oak Tree Mokku!

14
00:01:25,541 --> 00:01:30,799
title card

15
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:59,700
Good night.

16
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:11,360
[[NO AUDIO]]

17
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:24,320
Huh? What the hell does this old bastard think he's doing to my home?

18
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:37,100
Ow, that hurts.

19
00:02:40,155 --> 00:02:41,840
Huh? Yes, perfect, perfect.

20
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:57,460
You truly are the ideal oak log I could have ever wished for.

21
00:02:57,735 --> 00:03:00,640
I have been searching for you for such a long time.

22
00:03:01,064 --> 00:03:03,780
Tch, as if an oak could understand human words.

23
00:03:22,784 --> 00:03:25,000
Ah, looking good.

24
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:37,160
Ah! It's done! It's done! The wooden puppet is finished!

25
00:03:39,580 --> 00:03:44,600
You are my sweet grandson. I won't ever be lonely again.

26
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:47,400
Look! Look at that!

27
00:03:50,530 --> 00:03:54,380
He really was a kind-hearted old geez—no, a grandpa after all.

28
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,440
That's right, now you're a cute puppet!

29
00:03:57,441 --> 00:04:05,880
I've got to give you a name. Let's see... Oak Tree, Oak, Oakie... Hahaha, Oakie? Little Oakie!

30
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:13,640
Wood, timber... Mokku... Mokku... That's it! Mokku's perfect! It's decided!

31
00:04:13,924 --> 00:04:16,240
Mokku? Yes, that's it!

32
00:04:17,215 --> 00:04:21,519
There now. Be a good, healthy boy.

33
00:04:21,899 --> 00:04:34,340
Ah, right. You're a wooden puppet. You couldn't possibly understand me. But if only you could walk and talk like a real human child...

34
00:04:34,705 --> 00:04:36,040
What foolishness!

35
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:40,260
Forgive me, Mokku. I'm asking for the impossible.

36
00:04:40,570 --> 00:04:42,540
Well, it's getting late.

37
00:04:44,670 --> 00:04:46,040
Good night, Mokku.

38
00:04:53,890 --> 00:04:56,100
Hey, Mokku. Let's be pals.

39
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:58,620
After all, you used to be my home.

40
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:03,440
Well, guess I'll turn in too, Mokku.

41
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:35,460
[(MUSIC)]

42
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,600
[(MUSIC)]

43
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,260
[(MUSIC)]

44
00:05:43,261 --> 00:05:44,160
[(MUSIC)]

45
00:05:44,161 --> 00:05:50,800
(♪ Music)

46
00:06:04,900 --> 00:06:05,900
(Good night)

47
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:09,300
(Good night)

48
00:06:09,350 --> 00:06:10,400
(Good night)

49
00:06:10,660 --> 00:06:14,120
(Good night)

50
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:17,120
Ahhhhh...

51
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:41,540
Mokku, I am the Fairy of your home, the Oak Tree. Oji-san's kind heart made you into a puppet.

52
00:06:42,950 --> 00:06:48,820
I have heard Oji-san's wish, and I have come to give you life.

53
00:06:48,945 --> 00:06:51,620
Mokku, you are a wooden puppet.

54
00:06:53,180 --> 00:06:58,380
Yet from now on, you will be able to speak and move just like humans and animals.

55
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:03,740
Yet you are still a wooden puppet.

56
00:07:05,175 --> 00:07:08,540
I can grant you no more power than that.

57
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:15,140
Grant life to Mokku, the wooden puppet.

58
00:07:19,550 --> 00:07:21,580
Goodbye, Mokku.

59
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:24,780
Ah, she's vanishing.

60
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:51,480
Huh... Could what the Fairy said really be true? No way... Huh? Just my imagination?

61
00:07:51,481 --> 00:07:52,481
Huh?

62
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:10,300
Whoa, he moved!

63
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:13,560
Mokku, the wooden puppet, moved!

64
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,120
There you go!

65
00:08:28,055 --> 00:08:29,760
Steady, steady, steady!

66
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:32,280
You're doing great, Mokku!

67
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,640
Who am I?

68
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:35,500
Eh?

69
00:08:35,940 --> 00:08:37,820
Aah! W-Wait! Hey, hey, hey!

70
00:08:38,095 --> 00:08:39,740
Ow! Hey, that hurts, that hurts!

71
00:08:40,010 --> 00:08:40,900
H-Hey, let go!

72
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:42,700
My body isn't made of wood like yours, damn it!

73
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:45,680
Hey! I can't breathe! You're gonna kill me!

74
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:47,380
Let go of me, Mokku!

75
00:08:47,585 --> 00:08:48,620
Mokku?

76
00:08:49,139 --> 00:08:50,480
That's your name!

77
00:08:51,079 --> 00:08:53,480
Right, you were just born, so you don't know who you are yet.

78
00:08:53,765 --> 00:08:55,900
J-Just let go already!

79
00:09:12,509 --> 00:09:13,520
Serves you right!

80
00:09:18,479 --> 00:09:20,420
Look at you walking!

81
00:09:20,829 --> 00:09:21,860
Wheee!

82
00:09:22,325 --> 00:09:24,820
Not so good at falling, though!

83
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,840
(Grandpa snoring)

84
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:08,060
Ah! Stop it, Mokku! If you wake him suddenly, you'll scare Grandpa to death!

85
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:11,520
H-Hey! Stop it!

86
00:10:12,049 --> 00:10:14,320
You damn fool!

87
00:10:14,321 --> 00:10:15,321
You're so loud!

88
00:10:19,580 --> 00:10:21,320
Hey! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

89
00:10:29,839 --> 00:10:31,220
I am dead.

90
00:10:34,799 --> 00:10:35,799
Grandpa!

91
00:10:37,539 --> 00:10:38,539
Grandpa!

92
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,440
Wake up!

93
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:51,740
W-What is this? What's going on?

94
00:10:57,069 --> 00:11:04,260
A... A wooden puppet is right here. No, that's absurd... Am I dreaming?

95
00:11:05,020 --> 00:11:06,020
Ouch!

96
00:11:06,259 --> 00:11:07,900
The pain must be part of the dream too.

97
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:10,740
This hurts a bit too much, though.

98
00:11:13,979 --> 00:11:17,840
This isn't a dream, it's real! I can hear a voice.

99
00:11:18,115 --> 00:11:19,115
Mokku.

100
00:11:19,445 --> 00:11:20,820
What is it, Grandpa?

101
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:24,120
Mokku answered me!

102
00:11:24,525 --> 00:11:28,100
God has answered my prayers.

103
00:11:29,879 --> 00:11:31,940
You are my darling grandson.

104
00:11:32,460 --> 00:11:33,460
Come here, Mokku.

105
00:11:35,429 --> 00:11:41,340
I'm not lonely at all anymore. You're not just a puppet who sits there silently.

106
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:46,860
You're a living puppet who can talk with me and even go on walks.

107
00:11:48,419 --> 00:11:51,460
I'm so happy, Mokku.

108
00:11:55,220 --> 00:11:57,260
H-H-H-Hey! That hurts!

109
00:11:57,485 --> 00:12:01,260
Why, you little rascal! Ouch!

110
00:12:01,261 --> 00:12:02,261
Grandpa.

111
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:05,500
Grandpa.

112
00:12:11,255 --> 00:12:14,840
Mokku, Mokku, my sweet grandson.

113
00:12:39,870 --> 00:12:44,840
Hey, Mokku. Wake up. I bought you some clothes. Look!

114
00:12:44,940 --> 00:12:45,940
Clothes?

115
00:12:49,935 --> 00:12:51,160
Yes, right here.

116
00:12:58,309 --> 00:13:01,240
Mmm, not bad at all! It suits you nicely.

117
00:13:02,554 --> 00:13:04,020
Come on now, let's put on the pants.

118
00:13:06,340 --> 00:13:07,340
What's wrong?

119
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:12,040
What? Oh, I sold my overcoat, so this cold is just...

120
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:15,560
I'm fine, really.

121
00:13:16,409 --> 00:13:20,380
Come here now. Put these on. Go on, try them on.

122
00:13:21,220 --> 00:13:22,620
I love you, Grandpa!

123
00:13:23,380 --> 00:13:25,040
Thank you, Mokku.

124
00:13:28,619 --> 00:13:29,900
Good morning, Grandpa!

125
00:13:29,901 --> 00:13:31,580
We're here to celebrate!

126
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:38,920
Look, your friends are here. I invited them when I went shopping. Real human children!

127
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:44,060
They've come to celebrate your birthday. Come on in!

128
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:46,880
Come on now, gather over here.

129
00:13:48,239 --> 00:13:49,920
Grandpa, where is this Mokku kid?

130
00:13:50,420 --> 00:13:51,660
We came to celebrate!

131
00:14:00,410 --> 00:14:02,840
Come on out, Mokku.

132
00:14:10,299 --> 00:14:11,299
It's a wooden puppet!

133
00:14:12,509 --> 00:14:13,820
The puppet is walking!

134
00:14:19,959 --> 00:14:21,280
It's made so well!

135
00:14:22,980 --> 00:14:24,820
He's a wooden puppet.

136
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:28,920
How cute. I love puppets!

137
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:37,620
Play nicely together, everyone. I'll go find us something good to eat.

138
00:14:40,855 --> 00:14:43,760
Now, now. Stay and play with everyone, all right?

139
00:14:49,735 --> 00:14:52,880
I see. This bastard's made of oak.

140
00:14:56,969 --> 00:14:58,600
You asked for it, you damn puppet!

141
00:14:58,601 --> 00:14:59,601
No, stop!

142
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:06,380
You can copy humans all you want, but you're pure wood straight to the brain!

143
00:15:06,745 --> 00:15:07,745
Mokku!

144
00:15:09,669 --> 00:15:11,420
Here, this is a present from me!

145
00:15:13,539 --> 00:15:16,620
That flower smells wonderful!

146
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:19,720
Right?

147
00:15:22,979 --> 00:15:25,040
Fat chance! He's a wooden puppet!

148
00:15:28,199 --> 00:15:32,380
He can't smell a thing. Poor guy. Here, this is my present.

149
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:44,200
Hot!

150
00:15:44,660 --> 00:15:45,960
Franco, are you all right?

151
00:15:54,119 --> 00:15:55,020
Doesn't that burn?

152
00:15:55,021 --> 00:15:56,600
(laughter)

153
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:02,280
Stop it!

154
00:16:09,565 --> 00:16:14,300
Mokku, are you okay? Doesn't it hurt?

155
00:16:22,549 --> 00:16:23,780
(laughter)

156
00:16:29,100 --> 00:16:30,180
(laughs)

157
00:16:43,459 --> 00:16:50,140
Oh, Mokku!

158
00:16:51,135 --> 00:16:53,640
Poor thing, I'll fix you right up.

159
00:16:55,549 --> 00:17:00,700
It can't be helped. You are a wooden puppet, after all.

160
00:17:04,239 --> 00:17:11,200
There, a brand-new nose. Look, it's on! Wow, puppets sure are handy.

161
00:17:11,649 --> 00:17:13,520
There, try standing up.

162
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:21,960
Thank goodness.

163
00:17:23,449 --> 00:17:28,980
Mokku, I'll buy you books and a bag. Starting tomorrow, you'll go to school with everyone else.

164
00:17:53,880 --> 00:18:00,360
(Coins clinking)

165
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,960
Hey, Mokku!

166
00:18:07,629 --> 00:18:11,740
Mokku, this is awesome! It's way more fun than school!

167
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:13,420
I want to see!

168
00:18:13,564 --> 00:18:15,160
All right! Then cough up the admission fee!

169
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:17,040
Admission fee?

170
00:18:17,889 --> 00:18:19,000
Money, idiot!

171
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:20,800
Money?

172
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:29,520
The second-hand shop... this must be the place.

173
00:18:32,549 --> 00:18:33,720
Hey, Mokku!

174
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,760
You're the Cricket!

175
00:18:40,034 --> 00:18:42,740
That's right. I'm the ghost of the cricket you killed.

176
00:18:43,519 --> 00:18:47,240
Mokku, you're planning to sell your bag and books to see the puppet show, aren't you?

177
00:18:49,184 --> 00:18:52,200
The old man even sold his coat to buy you that bag and those books!

178
00:18:53,369 --> 00:18:55,240
But I really want to see it...

179
00:18:55,934 --> 00:19:00,240
Hmph! You ungrateful brat! Do something that rotten and you'll get what's coming to you!

180
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:01,480
Mind your own business!

181
00:19:02,449 --> 00:19:04,240
Ah, he vanished...

182
00:19:04,954 --> 00:19:06,360
You idiot! Are you trying to kill a ghost?!

183
00:19:07,319 --> 00:19:08,340
Shut up, you damn...!

184
00:19:11,759 --> 00:19:13,200
It's a puppet without strings!

185
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:14,400
They say he can even talk!

186
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:15,680
Yeah!

187
00:19:18,589 --> 00:19:21,800
Hmm, this little bastard is well-made.

188
00:19:22,860 --> 00:19:23,860
All right, bought!

189
00:19:26,159 --> 00:19:29,860
Hey, Mokku. The boss says he'll show you to the best seat in the house.

190
00:19:30,154 --> 00:19:31,340
Really? Thank you!

191
00:19:32,139 --> 00:19:34,000
Come on over here, Mokku.

192
00:19:41,994 --> 00:19:43,520
Oh, they're puppets just like me!

193
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:44,760
Wrong!

194
00:19:45,304 --> 00:19:49,020
Those are useless puppets that can't do a damn thing without my hands on them.

195
00:19:49,779 --> 00:19:52,660
But you move and talk all on your own.

196
00:19:54,424 --> 00:19:58,340
You're gonna make me a damn fortune! / No! I only came to watch!

197
00:19:58,844 --> 00:20:00,080
I'm not a sideshow attraction!

198
00:20:00,820 --> 00:20:01,820
Shut the hell up!

199
00:20:07,219 --> 00:20:09,440
Behave, or I'll smash you to pieces!

200
00:20:16,199 --> 00:20:17,640
What's going to happen to me?

201
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:19,960
Once you end up here, it's all over.

202
00:20:21,049 --> 00:20:23,320
You'll be put on display until the day you die.

203
00:20:24,639 --> 00:20:26,640
Just take a look inside that box.

204
00:20:35,229 --> 00:20:36,720
How horrible...

205
00:20:37,019 --> 00:20:41,740
Nothing we can do. Puppets can only move the way humans want them to.

206
00:20:42,289 --> 00:20:44,360
Puppets are just playthings for humans.

207
00:20:46,179 --> 00:20:51,300
Time to get this show started...

208
00:20:56,340 --> 00:20:57,340
What the hell?

209
00:20:59,420 --> 00:21:01,960
Broke before you did a damn bit of work!

210
00:21:07,469 --> 00:21:09,080
Watch what I do to you!

211
00:21:13,429 --> 00:21:15,240
Take this!

212
00:21:21,304 --> 00:21:24,501
How could he do something so awful... What the?!

213
00:21:28,419 --> 00:21:29,419
Come on, move!

214
00:21:32,069 --> 00:21:34,840
You're on. Get walking!

215
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:52,921
Step right up, ladies and gentlemen! Behold the wondrous wooden puppet that moves without a soul touching it, and even sings... Where is he?

216
00:21:53,894 --> 00:21:55,500
Show 'em what you've got!

217
00:21:56,514 --> 00:21:58,540
You idiot! Be more careful with him!

218
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:06,500
You idiot! Put on a smile and greet them properly!

219
00:22:19,140 --> 00:22:19,580
(Laughter)

220
00:22:19,581 --> 00:22:22,960
Good grief, see? I told you so.

221
00:22:23,334 --> 00:22:25,740
Come on, get to work already, Mokku!

222
00:22:28,820 --> 00:22:29,820
What's the matter?

223
00:22:31,264 --> 00:22:33,200
Hey, you slow bastard!

224
00:22:34,120 --> 00:22:36,340
(Laughter)

225
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:40,360
3

226
00:22:40,361 --> 00:22:40,800
2

227
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,240
1

228
00:22:50,819 --> 00:22:54,080
See? What did I tell you, you ungrateful brat?!

229
00:22:55,524 --> 00:22:59,640
Puppets are just toys for humans. Puppets are just toys for humans.

230
00:23:06,340 --> 00:23:13,140
Ohohohohoho! What?! Don't call me a puppet, I want to be human!

231
00:23:13,589 --> 00:23:15,780
Noooo!

232
00:23:16,879 --> 00:23:18,440
...to be...

233
00:23:19,659 --> 00:23:22,960
*Sobbing*

234
00:23:23,109 --> 00:23:24,220
2

235
00:23:24,819 --> 00:23:28,060
I want to be human!

236
00:23:33,349 --> 00:23:38,860
Mokku was made painfully aware of the sorrow of being a puppet, but he didn't cry for long.

237
00:23:40,334 --> 00:23:43,560
"I'll work in the puppet theater to buy Grandpa an overcoat."

238
00:23:45,469 --> 00:23:50,560
However, the greedy ringmaster broke his promise and worked Mokku to the bone.

239
00:23:52,029 --> 00:23:56,740
Taking his fellow puppets along, Mokku tries to escape from this dreadful master's manor.

240
00:23:57,939 --> 00:24:00,860
Look forward to next week's episode of Mokku of the Oak Tree.

241
00:24:10,789 --> 00:24:17,600
Mokku, Mokku, Mokku of the Oak Tree! Mokku, Mokku, Mokku of the Oak Tree!

242
00:24:20,659 --> 00:24:27,500
♪ With his little hat tilted to the side, Mokku! Call his name and his head spins right around, Mokku!

243
00:24:30,399 --> 00:24:35,960
♪ When Mokku laughs, everyone laughs!

244
00:24:36,989 --> 00:24:42,880
♪ Look, look, even the puppies come running!

245
00:24:44,059 --> 00:24:45,059
Kopi, kopi!

246
00:24:46,829 --> 00:24:48,620
Everyone's Mokku!

247
00:24:50,115 --> 00:24:53,140
Fun-loving Mokku!

248
00:24:53,141 --> 00:24:57,080
Look, look, look, look, Mokku of the Oak Tree!

249
00:25:10,554 --> 00:25:11,554
Kopi, kopi!

250
00:25:13,449 --> 00:25:15,620
Everyone's Mokku!

251
00:25:16,949 --> 00:25:23,820
Fun-loving Mokku, look, look, look, look, Mokku of the Oak Tree!

